(i) State of Rajasthan Vs. Harphool Singh reported in (2000) 5 SCC 652;
(ii) State of A.P. and others vs. Pioneer Builders A.P. reported in (2006) 12 SCC Cases 119;
(iii) P.T.Munichikanna Reddy and others vs. Revamma and others reported in (2007)
6 SCC 59.
(iv) R.Hanumaiah and another vs. Secretary to Government of Karnataka and others reported in (2010) 5 SCC 203;
(v) Mandal Revenue Officer vs. Goundla Venkaiah and another reported in (2010) 2 SCC 461;
